      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1956777341692088779",
      "text": "[6:50PM] #Jibowu_Yaba_Oyingbo #TrafficUpdate \n\nAdekunle intersection linking the 3rd Mainland Bridge inward and outward is very good.\nThe stretch of Herbert Macaulay Way from Adekunle down to Jibowu is good, except for slight delay at Sabo intersection due to traffic light alternation and slight delay also at Agnes due to the ongoing construction.\nJibowu inward and outward Fadeyi is very good.\nJibowu underneath the bridge inward and outward Empire is okay for now.\nYaba bridge linking Tejuosho is moving steadily, likewise the return journey.\nThe stretch of Muritala Mohammed Way from Yaba to Oyingbo is perfect.\nOyingbo inward Iddo enroute Otto is good to go, likewise the return journey.\nOyingbo inward Ile ile is busy due to the market activities.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
